      "data": {
        "text": "**Defining the Database Choice**\n\nI've decided to proceed with Google Cloud Firestore for this task. The code will need to clearly identify Firestore as the external provider.\n\n\n**Implementing the Fetch Logic**\n\nI'm now fully committed to Firestore and have a plan of action. I'm going to create `fetch_document.py` using the `write` tool. I'll focus on implementing the fetching logic with the `google-cloud-firestore` library. I'll make sure to include provider-specific signals within the code. Currently, I'm integrating placeholders for the project ID and document collection as a next step.\n\n\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789860683650,
